BPS authorization plugin for CLIProxyAPI

OAuth code adapted from:
  https://github.com/sunboyzoey/bps-local-public
  Commit: 203c716ccd1cad0452b5dc7535c46e6531e73af0
  Source files: internal/auth/device.go, internal/auth/renew.go,
                internal/auth/auth.go

The upstream LICENSE is reproduced unchanged as LICENSE.upstream. It contains
the baseline Unlicense and collected component-specific notices. This plugin
does not copy the upstream internal/basispoints inference implementation.

Changes made for this integration:
  - Split blocking device login into CPA start/poll sessions.
  - Reuse CPA proxy configuration and credential persistence.
  - Add bounded sessions, concurrency control, polling backoff, and cancellation.
  - Normalize independent BPS credentials and preserve CPA account settings.
  - Sanitize OAuth errors and support manual refresh without exchange retries.
  - Expose C ABI auth/CLI capabilities with local fixture and host integration tests.

The C ABI entrypoint follows the existing CLIProxyAPI Go plugin examples.
